OL,3,GNEWSATwenty babies born since maternity
OL,4,Aunit closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout 20 babies have been born in an
OL,7,Falternative hospital after the
OL,8,Ftemporary closure of a district
OL,9,Fmaternity unit, health bosses say.
OL,11,FMedical director Dr Karen Davies has
OL,12,Falso resigned from Royal Devon
OL,13,FUniversity Healthcare NHS Foundation
OL,14,FTrust (RDUH) in protest at its decision
OL,15,Fto  temporarily suspend births at North
OL,16,FDevon District Hospital in Barnstaple
OL,17,Fdue to staffing issues.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
