OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F346A1787117212
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj jsjkjcj j{jkjG2/2
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,***.*,*****& (,,
OL,3,GNEWSATwenty babies born since maternity
OL,4,Aunit closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe move was heavily criticised by
OL,7,Fpregnant women who now face long
OL,8,Fjourneys to give birth in Exeter, about
OL,9,F54 miles (87km) away, while the county
OL,10,Fcouncil leader said the closure was "a
OL,11,Fcatastrophic failure of senior
OL,12,Fmanagement".
OL,14,FSam Higginson, the trust's chief
OL,15,Fexecutive, said he wanted the
OL,16,Fsuspension to be short.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
